<title>BELGIUM: Electrafina says bought Lyonnaise shares on bourse.</title>
<headline>Electrafina says bought Lyonnaise shares on bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Electrafina, part of group GBL, recently bought shares in French utility group Lyonnaise des Eaux, a source close to Electrafina said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He said Electrafina had bought about three percent on the stock market.</p>
<p>As a result of the purchase Electrafina's fully diluted share in the soon-to-be-formed joint Compagnie de Suez /Lyonnaise group now amounted to nine percent.</p>
<p>Electrafina has 11.35 percent in Suez.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
